{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08535","headline":"送储邕之武昌 · 李白","name":"送储邕之武昌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄鹤西楼月，长江万里情。\n春风三十度，空忆武昌城。\n送尔难爲别，衔杯惜未倾。\n湖连张乐地，山逐泛舟行。\n诺爲楚人重，诗传谢朓清。\n沧浪吾有曲，寄入櫂歌声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08535.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08535","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}